{"sections":[{"slug":"Frobenius互反律","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Frobenius互反律"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">互反律</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Frobenius 互反律”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">互反律研究</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/诱导表示","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">诱导表示</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的不可约表示的重数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">特征理论</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为有限群</span>, $H\\subset G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为子群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\operatorname{Res}_H^G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为特征</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或类函数</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的限制</span>, $\\operatorname{Ind}_H^G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为类函数的诱导</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么两者互为伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>\n$$\r\n\\langle \\operatorname{Ind}_H^G\\psi,\\varphi \\rangle_G = \\langle \\psi, \\operatorname{Res}_H^G\\varphi \\rangle_H.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">模论</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为域</span>, $H\\subset G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为子群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{k[G]}(k[G]\\otimes_{k[H]}M,N) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{k[H]}(M,\\operatorname{Hom}_{k[G]}(k[G],N)),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特例</span>: $k[G]\\otimes_{k[H]}-$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/标量扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">标量扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\operatorname{Hom}_{k[G]}(k[G],-)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/标量限制","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">标量限制</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}